{
  "status": "REVIEWED",
  "keyPoints": [
    {
      "en": "Action words tell what someone does.",
      "hi": "काम वाले शब्द बताते हैं कि कोई क्या करता है।"
    },
    {
      "en": "I → am; he, she, it, one person → is",
      "hi": "I → am; he, she, it, एक व्यक्ति → is"
    },
    {
      "en": "we, you, they, many → are",
      "hi": "we, you, they, अनेक → are"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "problem": {
        "en": "Find the verb: \"The baby cries.\"",
        "hi": "क्रिया ढूँढो: \"The baby cries.\""
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "en": "What does the baby do?",
          "hi": "बच्चा क्या करता है?"
        }
      ],
      "answer": {
        "en": "cries",
        "hi": "cries"
      }
    },
    {
      "problem": {
        "en": "Fill in with is/am/are: \"They __ playing.\"",
        "hi": "is/am/are से भरो: \"They __ playing.\""
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "en": "\"They\" means many people, so use \"are\".",
          "hi": "\"They\" मतलब कई लोग, तो \"are\"।"
        }
      ],
      "answer": {
        "en": "They are playing.",
        "hi": "They are playing."
      }
    }
  ],
  "practice": [
    {
      "question": {
        "en": "Fill in: \"I __ happy.\"",
        "hi": "भरो: \"I __ happy.\""
      },
      "answer": {
        "en": "am",
        "hi": "am"
      }
    },
    {
      "question": {
        "en": "Fill in: \"The dog __ hungry.\"",
        "hi": "भरो: \"The dog __ hungry.\""
      },
      "answer": {
        "en": "is",
        "hi": "is"
      }
    },
    {
      "question": {
        "en": "Find the verb: \"Neha writes a letter.\"",
        "hi": "क्रिया ढूँढो: \"Neha writes a letter.\""
      },
      "answer": {
        "en": "writes",
        "hi": "writes"
      }
    }
  ],
  "intro": {
    "en": "Verbs are action words: run, write, eat, sleep. \"is\", \"am\" and \"are\" are special verbs: I am, he/she/it is, we/you/they are.",
    "hi": "क्रिया (verb) काम वाले शब्द हैं: run, write, eat, sleep। \"is\", \"am\", \"are\" ख़ास क्रियाएँ हैं: I am, he/she/it is, we/you/they are।"
  }
}
